{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "SingleR classic 模式要求测试与参考基因交集非空；若两者使用不同基因注释命名空间，可能因交集为空而报错。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "The function will automatically restrict the analysis to the intersection of the genes in both \\code{ref} and \\code{test}.\n#' If this intersection is empty (e.g., because the two datasets use different gene annotations), an error will be raised."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "参考矩阵要求行为基因、列为已知标签的参考样本，且每行应以基因名命名。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "@param ref A numeric matrix of expression values where rows are genes and columns are reference samples (individual cells or bulk samples).\n#' Each row should be named with the gene name."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "测试输入应为基因×细胞的数值表达矩阵，或携带该矩阵的 SummarizedExperiment 容器。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "@param test A numeric matrix of single-cell expression values where rows are genes and columns are cells.\n#' Alternatively, a \\link[SummarizedExperiment]{SummarizedExperiment} object containing such a matrix."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "测试表达无需 log 变换，因为 SingleR 只使用秩；原始 UMI 计数或转录计数也可直接使用。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "The test dataset does not need to be log-transformed, as only the ranks will be used by `SingleR()`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "参考表达一般期望为归一化并 log 变换后的值，但该归一化条件与是否启用自动 marker 检测相关，不能无条件推广到所有输入。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "In general, the expression values are expected to be normalized and log-transformed, see Details."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：经典 marker 选择主要面向高非零密度的 bulk 参考数据，对稀疏单细胞参考可能效果较差，这属于可检测性局限，不代表禁止使用。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "This is intended for reference datasets derived from bulk transcriptomic data (e.g., microarrays) with a high density of non-zero values. \n#' It is less effective for single-cell data, where it is not uncommon to have more than 50\\% zero counts for a given gene such that the median is also zero for each group."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "clarifying_question": "参考矩阵的行名是否与测试矩阵的行名使用完全相同的 Ensembl stable ID 版本（例如均不含版本号后缀）？"
}
